     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nFYI</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>From:</b> Malcom, Jacob W &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jacob_...@ios.doi.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, February 20, 2024 6:43 AM<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Advisor for Statistical Policy</span>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hello all—After some delays, the announcement for the new GS-14 Advisor for Statistical\r\n Policy with PPA is live! <a href=\"https://www.usajobs.gov/job/776885600\" style=\"margin:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.usajobs.gov/job/776885600&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492938152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jAIuwDrlTmbHjWQYwMWWJ\">\r\nhttps://www.usajobs.gov/job/776885600</a> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Please share with your networks and consider how you can reach beyond your regular\r\n network to help ensure we&#39;re reaching anyone who may be qualified, regardless of whether they&#39;re already &quot;connected,&quot; to help ensure as diverse an applicant pool as possible.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Here&#39;s a little blurb about the role:</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Want to help advance the use of data, statistics, and evidence to protect and manage\r\n the Nation&#39;s natural and cultural resources? To provide scientific and other knowledge about those resources? To help fulfill our Trust obligations to American Indians, Alaska Natives, Native Hawaiians, and affiliated Island Communities?</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Then come join the Office of Policy Analysis at the U.S. Department of the Interior\r\n in a new position, Advisor for Statistical Policy (GS-14)!</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">The breadth of the Department&#39;s mission means this position will have an untold number\r\n of topics to support as we build statistical policy and capacity. We&#39;re responsible for a wide swath of the Nation&#39;s natural capital and part of the National Strategy to develop statistical accounts for that capital...anticipate working on this. Serving a\r\n diverse Nation through 70,000 staff across the country, DEIA and statistics about our workforce and the public we serve are critical. Statistics on\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">natural disasters, critical minerals, climate change,\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Interior&#39;s economic impacts, supporting Indian Country, Bipartisan Infrastructure Law. Building capacity\r\n for data quality, essential for quality statistics and, of course, safe and effective Artificial Intelligence. The list goes on!</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Not only is there a diversity of topics to work on, you&#39;ll get to work with great people\r\n across our bureaus and offices, and with other Evidence Act officials like the Chief Data Officer and Evaluation Officer! We also have a growing Statistics and Evidence Community of Practice and adjacent communities that help bring folks together.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Cheers,</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Jacob</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>Jacob Malcom, PhD\r\n</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">(he/him)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Director, Office of Policy Analysis\r\n<i>and</i> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Statistical Official</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:12pt;margin:6pt 0in 0in\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Office of Policy Analysis |\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(23,78,134);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><a href=\"https://doi.gov/ppa\" style=\"color:rgb(23,78,134);margin:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://doi.gov/ppa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492938152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1x0XbGpgFpOKNRdkIwTT3Y\">https://doi.gov/ppa</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:12pt;margin:0in;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Policy, Management, and Budget</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(89,89,89)\">U.S. Department of the Interior</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(89,89,89)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(89,89,89);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Office: <a href=\"tel:(202)%20742-0988\" value=\"+12027420988\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">202.742.0988</a> |  </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Mobile:\r\n <a href=\"tel:(202)%20657-2877\" value=\"+12026572877\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">202.657.2877</a>  </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
